# Frontend Rules (`apps/web`)

Stack: Next.js App Router, React, TypeScript, TanStack Form + Query, Better Auth client (cookie session via `@elynd/auth`), Tailwind CSS **v4**, shadcn/base-nova under `components/ui/`.

Placement and package boundaries: **`layering.mdc`** + **`decisions.mdc`** (framework-agnostic; follow those first).

Filled Trellis notes (directory/state only): [`.trellis/spec/web/frontend/`](../../.trellis/spec/web/frontend/index.md). Ignore guides still marked **To fill**.

## TypeScript

- Extend `../../tsconfig.base.json`; override Next options (`module`/`moduleResolution`/`jsx`/`lib`/`noEmit`, …) in this app's `tsconfig.json`
- Keep Next `plugins`, `paths` (`@/*` → `./*`), and `include` (`.next/types`, `next-env.d.ts`) local

## Layout (Next mapping of layering)

| Layer | Location | Pattern |
|-------|----------|---------|
| Routes | `app/**` | thin pages; compose features |
| Features | `features/**` | domain UI, forms, feature hooks |
| Design system | `components/ui/` | shadcn atoms only |
| Shared non-feature UI | `components/` | providers/shell — not domain workflows |
| Auth client | `lib/auth/` | thin wrapper around `@elynd/auth/client` |
| Server state | `lib/query/` | TanStack Query (provider may exist before first `useQuery`) |
| Client UI state | `stores/` | Zustand — UI only (**create when a real UI-state need appears**) |
| Validation | `lib/validations/` | form-local Zod; auth limits from `@elynd/auth/policy`; cross-app contracts → `@elynd/shared` |
| Constants | `constants/` | app-wide literals used 2+ times |
| Static assets | `public/` | optional; empty dir kept with `.gitkeep` |

- Prefer existing `components/ui/`; add via shadcn CLI; custom only when the system cannot meet the need
- Ask before editing `components/ui/**` source (see `decisions.mdc` §8)
- NEVER treat Zustand as the source of truth for API/server data

## Styling

- Tailwind v4 only (`@import "tailwindcss"`, CSS-first theme)
- Prefer semantic theme tokens (`bg-background`, `text-muted-foreground`, etc.) over raw colors
- Format with shared Prettier config

## Auth

- Cookie session via same-origin `/api` rewrite to Nest (see `next.config.ts`)
- Prefer `@elynd/auth` inferred types (`AuthUser` / session shapes); do not reintroduce Bearer/`localStorage` token helpers unless a task explicitly changes auth mode
- Auth form password/username bounds: import `@elynd/auth/policy` — do not re-declare min/max/regex literals in web Zod

## Lint

Root `eslint.config.mjs` scopes `eslint-config-next` to `apps/web/**` (run via `pnpm lint` / `pnpm -w exec eslint apps/web`).
